WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.280
What network would you say is the worst, if I could ask?

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.200
Oh, man, that's a real tight spot.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.440
Honestly, it's a simple question.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.040
There's a lot of people in this pool.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.160
And I would say, I'm not talking about Fox.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:14.640
I'm not talking about Newsmax or any outlet that resembles them.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:16.440
So I'll let you guys put the pieces together

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.879
on who I'm exactly talking about.

00:00:17.879 --> 00:00:18.760
Who would you say, which network would you say?

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.120
MSNBC, for sure.

00:00:20.120 --> 00:00:20.959
Oh, they're terrible.

00:00:20.959 --> 00:00:21.459
I agree.

00:00:21.459 --> 00:00:23.160
CNN, probably close.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:27.280
Yeah, I'd rate it that way, MSNBC.

00:00:27.719 --> 00:00:32.439
Brian Roberts, that he allows that to happen is a disgrace.

00:00:32.439 --> 00:00:34.480
And CNN is second.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:37.160
I would say CNN is not quite as bad as MS.

00:00:37.160 --> 00:00:39.200
MSNBC is not really a news site anymore.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.119
Oh, MSNBC is sick.

00:00:41.119 --> 00:00:42.439
They're sick.

00:00:42.439 --> 00:00:44.799
Sir, it's also just the stories that they publish

00:00:44.799 --> 00:00:47.279
about what's the ICE enforcement operations that

00:00:47.279 --> 00:00:49.919
are so heavily slanted that it's no longer, as I was saying,

00:00:49.919 --> 00:00:52.240
no longer just Antifa, but Americans that

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:53.279
are becoming radicalized.

00:00:53.279 --> 00:00:55.759
So they've been very irresponsible with how

00:00:55.759 --> 00:00:57.160
they've been reporting on this.

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.080
MSNBC, for example, they're-

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.400
Would you rate them the worst?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.080
Probably.

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:02.919
Who would you rate second?

00:01:02.919 --> 00:01:06.160
Well, they ran a story about an operation in Southern California

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.720
about how a father of three Marines was arrested.

00:01:08.720 --> 00:01:12.160
And they made it seem like they just did it because he's brown.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:15.400
But there's video of that same man charging at the agents

00:01:15.400 --> 00:01:16.199
with a weed whacker.

00:01:16.199 --> 00:01:18.760
Now, I've worked with weed whackers back in the day.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.559
And you don't want to be in the receiving end of one of those.

00:01:20.559 --> 00:01:21.800
So that's why he was arrested.

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:25.120
But the story was presented as if it's a brown guy just

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:26.040
simply being arrested.

00:01:26.040 --> 00:01:28.000
And I've been around ICE agents.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:28.919
And I'm a citizen.

00:01:28.919 --> 00:01:31.040
So I feel fine.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:32.959
But it's just that's why.

00:01:32.959 --> 00:01:34.040
It's not just Antifa.

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:35.279
It's not happening in a vacuum.

00:01:35.279 --> 00:01:36.320
It's multiple factors.

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:37.879
No, it's working in conjunction.

00:01:37.879 --> 00:01:41.000
I think they work in conjunction with some of the media.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.400
I think ABC is very bad.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:44.440
I think NBC is very bad.

00:01:44.440 --> 00:01:45.800
And CBS has a new owner.

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:47.480
So we have hope for CBS.

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:50.239
CBS has a great new owner, my opinion.

00:01:50.239 --> 00:01:54.519
But I will tell you, ABC is terrible.

00:01:54.519 --> 00:01:55.559
NBC is terrible.

00:01:55.559 --> 00:01:58.239
NBC is MSNBC, too.

00:01:58.239 --> 00:01:59.040
They changed it.

00:01:59.040 --> 00:02:02.400
They moved it over legally so they couldn't be

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.800
tainted by the words MSNBC.

00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:07.199
But they are absolutely terrible.

00:02:07.199 --> 00:02:08.479
There are a lot of them.

00:02:08.479 --> 00:02:10.960
What about independents?

